does this mean in the verb filter of yii2 i need to allow get and post
===
What about GET method then?

In your action, you do allow getting refresh token value from a GET parameter:

$refreshToken = $request->cookies->getValue('refresh_token') 
                ?? $request->post('refresh_token') 
                ?? $request->get('refresh_token');

But the action itself only accepts POST requests.

So:

    If the request method is POST, you accept the refresh token from either cookie, POST body, or as a GET parameter.
    If the request method is GET, you reject outright with 400 Bad Request.

Your current code does not support GET requests.

