For a Yii2 controller that represents the idea of an art gallery and handles items such as artworks, exhibitions, artists, or gallery-related content, here are some suitable controller name suggestions that go beyond the generic "PostController":

    GalleryController — A classic choice, for managing galleries or a collection of artworks.
    ArtworkController — If you’re managing individual art pieces.
    ExhibitionController — If the focus is on exhibitions or events.
    ArtistController — If the focus is on artists and their profiles.
    CollectionController — If you want to emphasize curated collections of art.
    ArtPieceController — Another clear option for individual artworks.

Given your existing code snippet references categories such as 'news', 'gallery', and 'artists', it seems GalleryController fits well as the general controller name. It’s intuitive, directly representing an art gallery context and is broad enough to accommodate related entities.
