You're very close! Adding sorting and filtering for a related attribute through a relation in Yii2 GridView requires some additional steps in your SearchModel (MediaSearch.php), specifically:

    Add a public property to hold the related attribute (e.g., mediaFormatName).
    Modify the rules to mark it safe.
    Join with the related table in the search query.
    Modify the sort property of your data provider.
    Adjust the filtering conditions to filter on the related table's column.


